## ⚙️ 3. Workspace Layout & Key Files

```
project_root/
├── CLAUDE.md                   # Primary team constitution & operational protocol
├── .claude/
│   ├── settings.json           # Permissions, safe tool execution, environment variables
│   ├── agents/                 # Virtual team role definitions (architect, builder, reviewer, qa, skeptic)
│   └── rules/                  # Modular behavioral guidelines
│       ├── anti-slop.md        # Zero boilerplate & AI slop invariants
│       ├── context-diet.md     # Context window protection & targeted slice reads
│       ├── dnk-stack.md        # uv, pnpm, relative paths, MRH headers
│       └── git-workflow.md     # Atomic conventional commit rules
├── sessions/                   # Logged milestone sessions (synced to Git)
└── templates/
    └── SESSION_LOG_TEMPLATE.md # Template for capturing session receipts and decisions
```

