## 🔍 6. Verification Checklist

Before declaring a Claude Code workspace operational:
- [ ] `CLAUDE.md` explicitly lists core invariants (Karpathy senior rules + strict package managers).
- [ ] `.claude/settings.json` restricts dangerous or unapproved package managers (`pip`, `npm`).
- [ ] Subagents in `.claude/agents/` have distinct, non-overlapping mandates.
- [ ] Git tracking is initialized with atomic conventional commit rules.
- [ ] Session persistence template exists to capture learnings and prevent discussion amnesia.
